'''Leaves''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2023 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
Its blade is a gradient from yellow to orange with red autumn leaves in varying sizes imprinted on it, hence the name. The guard is golden, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==

* It is the second leaf themed knife in the game, the first being [[Leaf]] from [[Mystery Box 2]].

